		{
			description: [
				"&7front side&rshould be obvious,&9output side&ris the side with the dots or holes, by default this is the back side when you place the machine."
				""
				"Machines can perform&aautomatic output via their output surfaces. To enable automatic output, click the corresponding button in the GUI. The automatic output of fluids and items is toggled separately. The automatic output can be further controlled through the&doverlay plate &r."
				""
				"Use the&5wrench&rto right-click the machine to change the output side, and shift-right-click to change the front."
				""
				"By default, items and fluids cannot be inserted through the output side, but this can be switched using the&5screwdriver &r, by right-clicking directly on the output side, or shift-right-clicking on the mesh corresponding to the output side."
				""
				"There are some unique machines that do not handle recipes, such as&3pump &r,&3mining machine &r,&3fishing machine &r,&3item collector &r, etc., these machines will output&ron their&7front (still marked as points)."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:hopper"
